  text: "Our service is not intended for children under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us, and we will delete such information."
};
''',
        css: '''
return `._id {
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text};
}`;
'''
